  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Adds the dated design record for #5780, covering custody, offline journals/sync, the shell contract, the phone-provider model, and the Rust/Android build shape.\n- Answers the four open questions: thick/local-first client; sideload + Play distribution; #1831 events through the shared contract; and no guaranteed background wake without a push service.\n- Names seven implementation follow-ons; no Android implementation is included.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** `origin/main` at `af4e603e896a92bb3ddfbacb9d1089d83571f401` had no Android client design record.\n- **After:** `doc/2026-11-08T22-06-00Z_design_id_android_client/2026-11-08T22-06-00Z_design_id_android_client.md` contains all five requested sections and an acceptance mapping.\n- `git diff --cached --check` — pass; relative link to the #1831 input-event design — pass; code tests not applicable (documentation-only).\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\n**Blast Radius:** low\n\nThis is a design record only. Hardware-specific Keystore behavior and FFI/API details are explicit follow-on spikes; no runtime behavior changes here.\n\nCloses #5780\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796768013&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7826&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7826&signature=d38e8734dd02214a377427f18460abadd05362cde0c1e43e9ba3345e717847b5\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7826?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
